<div class="panel chatbot-setting">
    <div class="panel-heading" role="tab" id="headingReport">
        <h4 class="panel-title">
            <a role="button" data-toggle="collapse" href="#report" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="report">
                Reports
            </a>
        </h4>
    </div>
    <div id="report" class="panel-collapse collapse in" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="headingReport">
        <div class="panel-body has-padding">
            <p>Using Telegram Chatbot, you can get following reports right on Telegram without accessing to Alpha Site: <br /> Type "/help" on Chatbot for full list of commands</p>
            <table class="tblRpt tblRpt-bordered tbl-reports">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                       <th class="col-report">Report</th>
                       <th>Description</th>
                       <th class="col-how-it-works">How it works</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center bold">Outstanding</td>
                        <td>Get the total row of Alpha Outstanding Report of current Date. You can also get downlines' Outstanding report</td>
                        <td><button class="btn-chatbot btn-how-it-works">See how it works</button></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center bold">Balance Info</td>
                        <td>Get the Alpha Balance Info Report. You can also get downlines' Balance Info report</td>
                        <td><button class="btn-chatbot btn-how-it-works">See how it works</button></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center bold">Today Win Loss</td>
                        <td>Get the total row of Alpha Win Loss report of current date. You can also get downlines' Win Loss of current date</td>
                        <td><button class="btn-chatbot btn-how-it-works">See how it works</button></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="text-center bold">Yesterday Win Loss</td>
                        <td>Get the total row of Alpha Win Loss report of yesterday. You can also get downlines' Win Loss of yesterday</td>
                        <td><button class="btn-chatbot btn-how-it-works">See how it works</button></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
